blocks.en:
Every Phase-2 item also belongs to one of five hallucination families, the diagnostic axis of § 6 : (A) content or parametric errors in dates, entities or attributions, independent of
any context; (B) context or intrinsic errors that contradict or embellish the given context;
(C) linguistic or cultural errors of Bengali script, register, lexicon or translation;
(D) adversarial or robustness failures, from prompt injection to miscalibration; and (E) meta or
pipeline artifacts, such as ambiguous gold labels, imperfect sources and encoding variants, that a robust judge
should see through. The families divide into 32 failure modes of 50–400 items each.

blocks.zh:
每个第2阶段项目也属于五个幻觉家族中的一个,即第6节的诊断轴:(A)日期、实体或属性中的内容或参数误差,独立于
任何上下文;(B) 上下文或内在错误与给定上下文相矛盾或美化;
(C) 孟加拉文字、注册、词汇或翻译的语言或文化错误;
(D) 对抗性或强性故障,从迅速注射到校准不当;和
管道文物,如模糊的金色标签、不完善的来源和编码变体,一个强健的法官
应该通过。 家庭分为32种故障模式,每类50至400件。

